export const content = "<p><!--Continuation of my post <a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/itinerary-in-osaka-dotonbori-osaka-castle-shinsekai/\">Things to do in Osaka, Japan</a>--></p>\n<p>Before heading to Kyoto, I was feeling hungry and went to the street mall close to our accommodation. But unfortunately, all of the restos were still closed. This was the first one to open and I remember the other day when I passed this one, it has a lot of people waiting outside so I grabbed the opportunity to go here since it just opened and no any waiting lines yet.</p>\n<p>They are a tempura resto. They prepare and cook the food in front of you so it&#8217;s still hot and crispy and you eat it.<br />\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1004\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_114336_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20160419_114336_HDR\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1000\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1000 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_112110_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"tempura food kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">This woman is preparing the tempura and frying it in front of you..</figcaption></figure>\n<p>I got a tempura set. First, they gave me a bowl of rice an egg, tempura sauce and miso soup first. They instructed me to poke the yolk and mix it with the rice. Sooo yum!</p>\n<p>They give the tempura one by one as soon as it gets cooked. I went to Kyoto the next day.. to read visit &#8230;</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1001\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1001 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_113317_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"tempura food kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">egg yolk poked on top of rice.. yumm!!</figcaption></figure>\n<p>After eating, I&#8217;m on my way to explore Kyoto.. First stop is Kyoto Station.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1128\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_123941_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"tempura food kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1129\" style=\"width: 666px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"wp-image-1129 \" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_124004_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"kyoto tower kyoto station kyoto japan\" width=\"666\" height=\"1184\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Kyoto Tower outside Kyoto Station</figcaption></figure>\n<p>I always try to check first if there is a JR train going to my destination since I have a JR pass during this tour.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1132\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_124525_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"jr pass kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>On my way to Bamboo forest Kyoto..</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1134\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_124616_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"bamboo forest kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>Getting to the bamboo forest is easy. Just follow instructions starting from the train station and you are on your way..</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1058\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_132359_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"bamboo forest kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1061\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1061 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_132934_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"bamboo forest kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">small cemetery along bamboo forest</figcaption></figure>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1068\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_133530_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20160419_133530_HDR\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1079\" style=\"width: 533px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"wp-image-1079\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_141310_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"bamboo forest kyoto japan\" width=\"533\" height=\"948\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">i bought and ate soft serve vanilla ice cream while walking around</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1083\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1083 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_143238_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"bamboo forest kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">this really looks good during summer time where the leaves has different colors (red, yellow) and is nice</figcaption></figure>\n<p>On my way to my next destination..</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1084\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1084 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160419_180428_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"kyoto train station kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">inside kyoto station</figcaption></figure>\n<p>My next destination is the Golden Temple in Kyoto. You have to ride a bus going there and will take you around 1 hour bus drive (includes stop over)</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1125\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_121724_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"bus kyoto station golden temple kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>View on the way to the Golden Temple</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1097\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_101853_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"golden temple kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1098\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1098 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_105243_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"golden temple kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">guide map of the place..</figcaption></figure>\n<p>From the entrance to the Golden Template itself only takes few minutes of walk.. just follow the instructions (again)</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1101\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_105446_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"golden temple kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1110\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1110 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_110454_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"golden temple kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">The Magnificent Golden Temple</figcaption></figure>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1117\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_110905_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"golden temple kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1122\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1122 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_111744_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"golden temple kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">incense burner at a temple</figcaption></figure>\n<p>After visiting Golden Temple, I went right away to my next stop because I need to maximize my time for the day..</p>\n<p>Next stop, Fushimi Inari Shrine..</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1138\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_125739_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"fushimi inari shrine torii gates kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1144\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1144 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_130845_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"fushimi inari shrine torii gates kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Guide map inside Fushimi Inari Shrine Temple</figcaption></figure>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1139\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_130341_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"fushimi inari shrine torii gates kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1147\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-1147 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_131027_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"fushimi inari shrine torii gates kyoto japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">On the way to the famous thousands of vermilion torii gates</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1157\" style=\"width: 706px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"wp-image-1157\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160420_132655_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"fushimi inari shrine torii gates kyoto japan\" width=\"706\" height=\"1255\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Behind me is the path of the famous Inari Shrine&#8217;s Thousand Verimilion Torii Gates</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Soo.. That ends my day in Kyoto. I went back to Osaka after this to get rest and go out again at night..</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Other related blogs in Japan</strong><br />\nItineraries:<br />\n<a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/itinerary-in-osaka-dotonbori-osaka-castle-shinsekai/\">Things to do in Osaka, Japan<br />\n</a><a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/itinerary-in-tokyo-sensoji-temple-meiji-shrine-tsukiji-market-ueno-park-shinjuku-shibuya/\">Things to do in Tokyo, Japan</a><a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/itinerary-in-kyoto-golden-temple-bamboo-forest-fushimi-inari-shrine/\"><br />\n</a><a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/things-to-do-in-fukuoka-japan-nanzoin-temple-yatai-ippudo/\">Things to do in Fukuoka, Japan</a></p>\n<p>Food:<br />\n<a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/best-tonkotsu-ramen-fukuoka-japan-yatai-ippudo-ramen-street/\">Where to get ramen in Fukuoka, Japan</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/osaka-dotonbori-non-stop-eating/\">Eat til you drop in Dotonbori, Osaka, Japan</a></p>\n<p>Accommodation:<br />\n<a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/where-to-stay-in-japan-tokyo-osaka-kyoto-fukuoka/\">Where to stay in Fukuoka, Osaka &amp; Tokyo, Japan</a></p>\n"
